 or grievous hurt (IPC Section-386)\u003Cbr>\u003C/li>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan class=\"w3-badge w3-red w3-tiny\"> 1 \u003C/span> charges related to Criminal breach of trust by clerk or servant (IPC Section-408)\u003Cbr> \u003C/li>\u003C/ul> \u003C/div>\n\t\t\n\t\u003Cdiv class=\"w3-panel w3-leftbar w3-sand\">\u003Ch3>Cases where accused \u003C/h3>\u003C/div>\n\t\u003Cdiv class=\"w3-responsive\">\n\t\u003Ctable id=\"cases\" class=\"w3-table w3-striped w3-bordered\">\n\t\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr style=\"font-weight:bold\">\u003Ctd>Serial No.\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>IPC Sections Applicable\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Other Details / Other Acts / Sections Applicable\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\t\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd> 1\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>341, 347, 386, 408 \u003C/td>\u003Ctd> Case No. 80/98, Ps. Atri, Court Taking Cognizance C.J.M Gaya, Date of Cognizance 08.07.2005 \u003C/td>\u003Ctd>\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\n\t\u003C/div>\n\t\u003Cdiv class=\"w3-panel w3-leftbar w3-sand\">\u003Ch3>Cases where convicted \u003C/h3>\u003C/div>\n\t\u003Cdiv class=\"w3-responsive\">\n\t\u003Ctable id=\"cases\" class=\"w3-table w3-striped w3-bordered\">\n\t\u003Ctbody>\u003Ctr style=\"font-weight:bold\">\u003Ctd>Serial No.\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>IPC Sections Applicable\u003C/td>\u003Ctd>Other Details / Other Acts / Sections Applicable\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\t\u003Ctr>\u003Ctd colspan=\"4\" align=\"center\">---------\u003Cb>No Cases\u003C/b>--------\u003C/td>\u003C/tr>\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\u003C/tbody>\u003C/table>\n\t\u003C/div>\n\t\t\u003Cp>\u003Csmall style=\"color:#FF0000\">Disclaimer: This information is an archive of the candidate's self-declared affidavit that was filed during the elections. The current status of this information may be different. For the latest available information, please refer to the affidavit filed by the candidate to the Election Commission in the most recent election.\u003C/small>\u003C/p>\t\u003Cb>Data Readability Report of Criminal Cases :\u003C/b>No Problems in Readin